@startuml sequence_auth
!theme plain
autonumber

actor "Utilisateur (Client/Pharmacien)" as User
participant "Frontend (Nuxt)" as UI
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "User Manager Service" as Auth
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

title Diagramme de séquence : Authentification

User -> UI : Saisit Identifiants (Email, Password)
UI -> Gateway : POST /auth/login
activate Gateway

Gateway -> Auth : Request: login_user(email, password)
activate Auth

Auth -> DB : Find user by email
activate DB
DB --> Auth : User Record (Hashed Password)
deactivate DB

Auth -> Auth : Comparer les mots de passe (bcrypt)

alt Identifiants valides
    Auth -> Auth : Générer JWT Access Token
    Auth --> Gateway : Response: { user, accessToken }
    Gateway --> UI : 200 OK + JWT
    UI -> UI : Stocker JWT dans localStore/Vuex
    UI --> User : Redirection vers Dashboard
else Identifiants invalides
    Auth --> Gateway : Error: Unauthorized
    deactivate Auth
    Gateway --> UI : 401 Unauthorized
    UI --> User : Message: Email ou mot de passe incorrect
end
deactivate Gateway

@enduml
